  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The void is a major threat in this game. It is summoned by the memories
    of past agony from the location experienced by others in the past. This makes
    it an  \"Agony Entity\" and is extremely agressive toward anyone in the location.
    It slowly consumes everything in its way. \n\nIf the lights are switched off,
    it activates and starts consuming the office. Turn the lights back on to push
    it away. Since this entity spawns with the lights off, it is very dangerous because
    you have to turn the lights off to not get killed by frozen freddy.\n\nTo survive
    the void, you have to balance fighting off freddy and pushing away the void.
    This makes it one of the most dangerous threats in the game."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
