  m_text: "For Foxy, you will have to control the temperature using the button in
    the bottom left corner of the screen. If you let it get above 20\xB0, he will
    gradually get more aggressive and leave his cove and jumpscare you, causing a
    game over. Calm him down by keeping the temperature below 20\xB0 at all times."
